    "memoText": " \n                         VETO MESSAGE - No. 100\n \nTO THE SENATE:\n \nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n \nSenate Bill Number 7410-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN  ACT  to grant retroactive membership with Tier IV status in the\n      New York State and Local  Employees'  Retirement  System  to  Dawn\n      Ward\"\n \n    NOT APPROVED\n \n  This  bill provides retirement tier reclassification for an individual\npublic employee.\n \n  I have great respect for our public sector workforce, who  have  dedi-\ncated their lives to supporting their fellow New Yorkers. However, there\nare  similarly  situated  employees  throughout the State, and this bill\nwould provide a tier reclassification to only one individual.  It  would\nnot  be  appropriate  to  grant  such benefits to one individual but not\nothers.\n\n  Therefore, I am constrained to veto this bill.\n \n  The bill is disapproved.                       (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n \n                               __________\n",
    "signedDate": null,
    "signer": "KATHY HOCHUL",
    "vetoNumber": 100,
    "vetoType": "STANDARD",
    "year": 2024
   }
